$MDESC::Type = "Find and Retrieve";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Find and Retrieve" @
	"\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Fiafagon" @
	"\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Partly Cloudy" @
	"\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @
	"\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	"\n\n<f1>Briefing: <f0> Welcome to the Temple of doom.  Your goal, to retrieve 3 flags from 3 different and deadly rooms: The Crusher, The Maze of Death, and The Room of No Escape.  Survive them and you will have the prize.  But there are others who want the prize and will kill you for it.  Be mindful for as you may escape a room with a flag you my find that the deadly part is just waitng outside.  So maybe you also will watch as your foe gets a flag out for you, then you say THANKS and rip him to shreds.  Also, to win this match you must own the other teams base by hitting the switch in the base.  But watch out, you better defend yours.  Map By: [HvC]Leviathan";
